uding humans but excluding plants.\"\n- (noun) \"A creature other than a human, especially a mammal rather than a bird, fish, or insect.\"\n- (noun) \"A person who behaves in a cruel, violent, or uncivilized way.\"\n- (adjective) \"Relating to animals or derived from animals.\"\n- (adjective) \"Relating to physical appetites and instincts rather than reason or spiritual qualities.\""}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"animal","pos":"noun","gloss":"A person or thing of a particular type.","siblings":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A living creature that feeds on organic matter and typically can move and respond to its surroundings, including humans but excluding plants."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A creature other than a human, especially a mammal rather than a bird, fish, or insect."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A person who behaves in a cruel, violent, or uncivilized way."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Relating to animals or derived from animals."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Relating to physical appetites and instincts rather than reason or spiritual qualities."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-10T07:46:32.127Z"}', '2026-11-10T07:30:19.687Z', '2026-11-10T07:46:32.127Z', NULL, NULL);
