dy.\"\n- (adjective) \"Served without being heated or after being allowed to cool.\"\n- (adjective) \"Showing little affection, sympathy, or friendliness.\"\n- (adjective) \"Based on facts and reasoning without the influence of emotion.\"\n- (adjective) \"No longer fresh enough to provide useful clues about someone or something being sought.\"\n- (adjective) \"Far from finding a hidden object or guessing the correct answer in a game.\"\n- (adjective) \"Giving an impression of coolness through blue, green, or grey tones.\"\n- (adjective) \"Unconscious.\"\n- (noun) \"A common viral infection of the nose and throat that causes sneezing, a runny nose, and sometimes a cough.\"\n- (noun) \"A low temperature, especially in the weather or surrounding air.\"\n- (adverb) \"Without preparation, practice, or prior knowledge.\"\n- (adverb) \"Suddenly and completely.\"\n- (adverb) \"Completely and accurately from memory.\"\n- (adjective) \"Showing no emotion or pity when harming others.\"\n- (adjective) \"Unpleasant or depressing because it offers no comfort or hope.\""}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"cold","pos":"adjective","gloss":"Done without preparation or prior knowledge.","siblings":[{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Having a low temperature or a temperature lower than is comfortable."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Feeling a lack of warmth in the body."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Served without being heated or after being allowed to cool."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Showing little affection, sympathy, or friendliness."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Based on facts and reasoning without the influence of emotion."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"No longer fresh enough to provide useful clues about someone or something being sought."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Far from finding a hidden object or guessing the correct answer in a game."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Giving an impression of coolness through blue, green, or grey tones."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Unconscious."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A common viral infection of the nose and throat that causes sneezing, a runny nose, and sometimes a cough."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A low temperature, especially in the weather or surrounding air."},{"pos":"adverb","gloss":"Without preparation, practice, or prior knowledge."},{"pos":"adverb","gloss":"Suddenly and completely."},{"pos":"adverb","gloss":"Completely and accurately from memory."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Showing no emotion or pity when harming others."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Unpleasant or depressing because it offers no comfort or hope."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-10T07:18:18.581Z"}', '2026-11-10T07:07:32.102Z', '2026-11-10T07:18:18.581Z', NULL, NULL);
