zation with particular views or responsibilities.\"\n- (noun) \"A section of a building that extends from the main part.\"\n- (noun) \"A bird''s wing prepared or served as food.\"\n- (noun) \"One of the areas at the sides of a theatre stage hidden from the audience.\"\n- (noun) \"Either side of the playing field in certain team sports.\"\n- (noun) \"A player who plays near the side of the field in certain team sports.\"\n- (noun) \"A body panel covering a wheel of a motor vehicle.\"\n- (verb) \"To perform or deal with something without preparation.\"\n- (verb) \"To fly or travel swiftly through the air.\"\n- (verb) \"To wound a bird in a wing or a person in an arm with a shot.\"\n- (noun) \"A military aviation unit consisting of several squadrons.\"\n- (noun) \"Either of the side sections of an army or fleet arranged for battle.\"\n- (noun) \"A badge shaped like a pair of wings worn by a qualified pilot.\""}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"wing","pos":"noun","gloss":"One of the flat structures extending from the sides of an aircraft that provide lift.","siblings":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"One of the parts of a bird, bat, or insect used for flying."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A group within a political party or organization with particular views or responsibilities."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A section of a building that extends from the main part."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A bird''s wing prepared or served as food."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"One of the areas at the sides of a theatre stage hidden from the audience."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"Either side of the playing field in certain team sports."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A player who plays near the side of the field in certain team sports."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A body panel covering a wheel of a motor vehicle."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To perform or deal with something without preparation."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To fly or travel swiftly through the air."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To wound a bird in a wing or a person in an arm with a shot."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A military aviation unit consisting of several squadrons."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"Either of the side sections of an army or fleet arranged for battle."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A badge shaped like a pair of wings worn by a qualified pilot."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-12T11:15:51.475Z"}', '2026-11-12T11:15:45.939Z', '2026-11-12T11:15:51.475Z', NULL, NULL);
