mising clues about someone or something being sought.\"\n- (adjective) \"Very close to finding a hidden object or guessing the correct answer in a game.\"\n- (adjective) \"Having a strong taste that causes a burning feeling in the mouth.\"\n- (adjective) \"Very popular, fashionable, or in great demand.\"\n- (adjective) \"Causing strong disagreement, excitement, or public interest.\"\n- (adjective) \"Sexually attractive.\"\n- (adjective) \"Feeling strong sexual desire.\"\n- (adjective) \"Stolen and therefore risky to possess or sell.\"\n- (adjective) \"Very skilful at a particular activity or knowledgeable about a particular subject.\"\n- (adjective) \"Newly obtained or produced and very recent.\"\n- (adjective) \"Very interested in or eager for something.\"\n- (adjective) \"Very likely to win or succeed.\"\n- (adjective) \"Strict or insistent about making sure a rule or standard is followed.\"\n- (verb) \"To become more lively, exciting, or intense.\"\n- (adjective) \"Carrying an electric current that could cause an electric shock.\"\n- (adjective) \"Dangerous or likely to cause trouble.\""}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"hot","pos":"adjective","gloss":"Involving intense activity, competition, or emotion.","siblings":[{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Having a high temperature or a temperature higher than is comfortable."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Recent enough to provide promising clues about someone or something being sought."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Very close to finding a hidden object or guessing the correct answer in a game."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Having a strong taste that causes a burning feeling in the mouth."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Very popular, fashionable, or in great demand."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Causing strong disagreement, excitement, or public interest."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Sexually attractive."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Feeling strong sexual desire."},{"pos":"adjective","gloss":"Stolen and therefore risky to posse