lternative forms conditioned by the next sound.\nfail: a misspelling, a form of another type, or a form no sense of the word takes.\nThe word''s senses:\n- (noun) \"An animal that lives in water, breathes through gills, and has fins.\"\n- (verb) \"To try to catch fish.\""}}}]},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"fish","senses":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"An animal that lives in water, breathes through gills, and has fins."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To try to catch fish."}]},"target":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-09T08:56:46.809Z"}', '2026-11-09T08:56:38.377Z', '2026-11-09T08:56:46.809Z', NULL, NULL);
