ards.\""}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"cat","pos":"noun","gloss":"A small domesticated animal with soft fur, whiskers, and retractable claws, often kept as a pet.","siblings":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A wild animal of the same family as the domestic cat, including lions, tigers, and leopards."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-09T23:06:21.148Z"}', '2026-11-09T23:06:09.805Z', '2026-11-09T23:06:21.148Z', NULL, NULL);
