ung woman.\"\n- (noun) \"A person of a particular type or character.\"\n- (noun) \"Time spent in prison.\""}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"bird","pos":"noun","gloss":"A shuttlecock used in badminton.","siblings":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"An animal with feathers, wings, and a beak that lays eggs and is usually able to fly."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A girl or young woman."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A person of a particular type or character."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"Time spent in prison."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-10T08:30:01.743Z"}', '2026-11-10T08:11:23.230Z', '2026-11-10T08:30:01.743Z', NULL, NULL);
