mething out of a place, especially with difficulty.\""}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"fish","pos":"verb","gloss":"To try to catch fish.","siblings":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"An animal that lives in water, breathes through gills, and has fins."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To try indirectly to obtain something from someone."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"The flesh of fish eaten as food."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To search for something by feeling around with the hands."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A person of a particular kind or character."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To pull or take something out of a place, especially with difficulty."}]},"target":null,"topic":{"category":"Leisure and sport","topic":"Outdoors and camping"}},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-10T02:07:12.972Z"}', '2026-11-09T23:09:31.057Z', '2026-11-10T02:07:12.972Z', NULL, NULL);
