s not a part-of-speech error.\n- A usage note in brackets such as （表示…）, alongside an equivalent or in place of one.\nfail when any of these holds:\n- It means something else, or any listed equivalent is wrong for this sense, even when a bracketed note explains the usage correctly.\n- For a verb sense, an equivalent only names a thing or quality and cannot be used as a verb.\n- It renders a phrase or phrasal verb that contains the word instead of the word in this sense.\n- It renders a different sense of the word, such as one of the other senses listed below.\n- It is unnatural or ungrammatical in the target language.\n- It lists equivalents of several unrelated senses.\nOther senses of this entry, for reference:\n- (noun) \"An animal that lives in water, breathes through gills, and has fins.\"\n- (verb) \"To try to catch fish.\"\n- (verb) \"To try indirectly to obtain something from someone.\"\n- (verb) \"To search for something by feeling around with the hands.\"\n- (noun) \"A person of a particular kind or character.\"\n- (verb) \"To pull or take something out of a place, especially with difficulty.\""}},"context":{"subject":{"lemma":"fish","pos":"noun","gloss":"The flesh of fish eaten as food.","siblings":[{"pos":"noun","gloss":"An animal that lives in water, breathes through gills, and has fins."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To try to catch fish."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To try indirectly to obtain something from someone."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To search for something by feeling around with the hands."},{"pos":"noun","gloss":"A person of a particular kind or character."},{"pos":"verb","gloss":"To pull or take something out of a place, especially with difficulty."}]},"target":null,"topic":null},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-10T03:34:01.493Z"}', '2026-11-10T03:33:56.959Z', '2026-11-10T03:34:01.493Z', 'zh', NULL);
