l dog with short hair and long hanging ears, traditionally used for hunting rabbits and hares.","review":{"fact_id":"50cea09e-ad5d-41bb-b870-069d84e242c0","confidence":0.96,"verdict":"pass"}}],"part_of":[],"parts":[]},"review":{"gloss":{"fact_id":"b8e95e86-bc3c-468a-90bc-7c0707cff6ea","confidence":1,"verdict":"pass"},"translations":{"zh":[{"fact_id":"d86f04ee-d470-488b-944f-46106c7e3174","confidence":1,"verdict":"pass"}]}}},{"id":"29ebf1fb-d287-44f5-9481-a7cc2a3d451f","image":null,"gloss":"A male dog or a male of a related animal such as a fox.","labels":[],"region":null,"rare":false,"translations":{"zh":["公狗；雄性犬科动物"]},"grammar":{"countability":"countable","patterns":[],"prepositions":[],"review":{"fact_id":"4554deb9-9824-422c-b273-394800a976a8","confidence":0.95,"verdict":"pass"}},"examples":[{"sentence_id":"9554890c-5420-4421-89c0-6d97915edbde","text":"Is your new puppy a dog or a bitch?","translations":{"zh":"你新养的小狗是公的还是母的？"},"review":{"fact_id":"51d21a62-8026-4ea8-927b-660dcfb21d87","confidence":0.99,"verdict":"pass"}},{"sentence_id":"e3e37a1b-7263-4fa7-9519-de9197d0d585","text":"The breeder keeps the dogs and bitches in separate kennels.","translations":{"zh":"繁育者把公狗和母狗养在不同的犬舍里。"},"review":{"fact_id":"1ac7c481-0bb2-4724-97d5-68d2a16c4438","confidence":0.99,"verdict":"pass"}}],"collocations":[{"text":"stud dog","pattern":"noun_noun","translations":{"zh":"种公犬"},"review":{"fact_id":"623377ee-501d-4eec-bde2-decfdc11775c","confidence":0.97,"verdict":"pass"}}],"topics":[],"relations":{"synonyms":[{"lemma":"boy","sense_id":"1cb44c8e-4f30-4e7e-a6c6-c6cc597ef1c5","gloss":"A male dog, especially when spoken to affectionately.","review":{"fact_id":"62d2dfaf-131e-40bd-be91-f82d5d8f3b64","confidence":0.94,"verdict":"pass"}}],"antonyms":[],"broader":[{"lemma":"male","sense_id":"79ee1bbc-430b-44ad-a287-ce69c57783a4","gloss":"A male person or animal.","review":{"fact_id":"759592d0-01ad-4596-a2d2-70d94b2e0603","confidence":0.99,"verdict":"pass"}}],"narrower":[],"part_of":[],"parts":[]},"review":{"gloss":{"fact_id":"b8e95e86-bc3c-468a-90bc-7c0707cff6ea","confidence":1,"verdict":"pass"},"translations":{"zh":[{"fact_id":"9c28cb5c-9e27-41cc-b701-e86c074270e7","confidence":0.99,"verdict":"pass"}]}}},{"id":"019f3880-da23-4b2e-bdd6-035326f6885d","image":null,"gloss":"A man described in a familiar or affectionate way as having a particular quality.","labels":["informal"],"region":null,"rare":false,"translations":{"zh":["家伙（对男子的亲昵称呼）"]},"grammar":{"countability":"countable","patterns":[],"prepositions":[],"review":{"fact_id":"17230db7-44ff-485b-ab0d-3a665d266d72","confidence":0.9,"verdict":"pass"}},"examples":[{"sentence_id":"5b3df9eb-4ea7-43a4-a529-2f42488397fb","text":"You lucky dog! I wish I could go on holiday too.","translations":{"zh":"你这个幸运的家伙！我也希望能去度假。"},"review":{"fact_id":"3a881793-8b60-44be-9eed-6cdd8c9ce7c2","confidence":0.99,"verdict":"pass"}},{"sentence_id":"9f6dadfa-3d3c-4e08-a662-c76354693244","text":"He''s a sly old dog, but I like him.","translations":{"zh":"他是个狡猾的老家伙，不过我喜欢他。"},"review":{"fact_id":"cebb3f21-e4fd-4623-a646-6faa9f29b5c8","confidence":0.99,"verdict":"pass"}}],"collocations":[{"text":"lucky dog","pattern":"adjective_noun","translations":{"zh":"幸运儿"},"review":{"fact_id":"ea1a272b-4108-40b6-be6f-9dd22a8dfb49","confidence":0.99,"verdict":"pass"}},{"text":"sly old dog","pattern":"adjective_noun","translations":{"zh":"狡猾的老家伙"},"review":{"fact_id":"250b1c0a-108a-44c9-a2ac-7d6058d1ddca","confidence":0.98,"verdict":"pass"}}],"topics":[],"relations":{"synonyms":[{"lemma":"fellow","sense_id":"3eba2815-b669-41c4-be7d-aec11aff587c","gloss":"A man referred to in a familiar or informal way.","review":{"fact_id":"04a3779c-64b5-416e-80bf-7b2ad4d965e8","confidence":0.97,"verdict":"pass"}}],"antonyms":[],"broader":[],"narrower":[],"part_of":[],"parts":[]},"review":{"gloss":{"fact_id":"b8e95e86-bc3c-468a-90bc-7c0707cff6ea","confidence":1,"verdict":"pass"},"translations":{"zh":[{"fact_id":"9354213c-7018-46b7-a964-80048f52ac78","confidence":0.99,"verdict":"pass"}]}}},{"id":"18a43355-471e-45de-8c26-5f0e4fc635ea","image":null,"gloss":"A person, especially a man, regarded as unpleasant or contemptible.","labels":["informal"],"region":null,"rare":false,"translations":{"zh":["卑鄙小人；无赖"]},"grammar":{"countability":"countable","patterns":[],"prepositions":[],"review":{"fact_id":"1f7627f8-c883-4750-9792-c854bc2a5928","confidence":0.93,"verdict":"pass"}},"examples":[{"sentence_id":"e6a2a8ba-8162-4638-86eb-629a10178d82","text":"You dirty dog! You knew she was married.","translations":{"zh":"你这个卑鄙的家伙！你明明知道她已经结婚了。"},"review":{"fact_id":"7685c9b9-dd02-4bec-b229-c0069fe45866","confidence":0.99,"verdict":"pass"}},{"sentence_id":"0d34dafa-44e8-4664-9b50-ad4bf3de2cc8","text":"That lying dog stole money from his own mother.","translations":{"zh":"那个满嘴谎话的无赖竟然偷自己母亲的钱。"},"review":{"fact_id":"51380731-f5e9-4fcb-9739-807b3898599b","confidence":0.98,"verdict":"pass"}}],"collocations":[{"text":"dirty dog","pattern":"adjective_noun","translations":{"zh":"卑鄙的家伙"},"review":{"fact_id":"362ed66d-4e78-42a2-a187-13a3eff8192b","confidence":0.98,"verdict":"pass"}}],"topics":[],"relations":{"synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"broader":[],"narrower":[],"part_of":[],"parts":[]},"review":{"gloss":{"fact_id":"b8e95e86-bc3c-468a-90bc-7c0707cff6ea","confidence":1,"verdict":"pass"},"translations":{"zh":[{"fact_id":"962b4530-f259-4893-8ab7-7c42b8b2cfb1","confidence":0.99,"verdict":"pass"}]}}},{"id":"8242b453-1470-4de0-822b-ec49a97a212a","image":null,"gloss":"Something of very poor quality or something that is a commercial failure.","labels":["informal"],"region":null,"rare":false,"translations":{"zh":["劣质品；失败之作"]},"grammar":{"countability":"countable","patterns":[],"prepositions":[],"review":{"fact_id":"3080cf8b-bd9b-4cd2-bdcb-56d5b8563655","confidence":0.88,"verdict":"pass"}},"examples":[{"sentence_id":"eaf6dfe3-07b5-4622-a646-477f43126ca2","text":"The used car I bought turned out to be a dog.","translations":{"zh":"我买的那辆二手车结果是辆破车。"},"review":{"fact_id":"4bf9fb1c-870a-4f7b-8d48-aea90f198bbe","confidence":0.99,"verdict":"pass"}},{"sentence_id":"1bdef781-db1c-42c5-9bfa-ef52f0b0e67a","text":"Their latest film was a real dog and lost millions at the box office.","translations":{"zh":"他们的最新电影是一部十足的烂片，票房亏损了数百万。"},"review":{"fact_id":"f30822aa-e00a-4caa-b39a-19cb2826e9f5","confidence":0.98,"verdict":"pass"}}],"collocations":[{"text":"a real dog","pattern":"adjective_noun","translations":{"zh":"一件十足的劣质品"},"review":{"fact_id":"e74c0a61-5764-41da-a232-1c20d5b32c46","confidence":0.92,"verdict":"pass"}}],"topics":[],"relations":{"synonyms":[{"lemma":"lemon","sense_id":"701853e6-f723-43ba-8562-b323d395ffd7","gloss":"A product, especially a vehicle, that is defective or works poorly.","review":{"fact_id":"91259c1a-8403-4c0d-bb1a-1a5399c0d313","confidence":0.91,"verdict":"pass"}}],"antonyms":[],"broader":[],"narrower":[],"part_of":[],"parts":[]},"review":{"gloss":{"fact_id":"b8e95e86-bc3c-468a-90bc-7c0707cff6ea","confidence":1,"verdict":"pass"},"translations":{"zh":[{"fact_id":"83fc950e-6a6b-4492-b1b9-9e62e1f89a31","confidence":0.99,"verdict":"pass"}]}}},{"id":"7984c21b-e4b3-41f9-b200-2e40c166b569","image":null,"gloss":"A woman considered physically unattractive.","labels":["offensive"],"region":null,"rare":false,"translations":{"zh":["丑女（侮辱性称呼）"]},"grammar":{"countability":"countable","patterns":[],"prepositions":[],"review":{"fact_id":"cf08dab5-f4e3-4f8d-b1ce-38a87e8669b0","confidence":0.89,"verdict":"pass"}},"examples":[{"sentence_id":"f3cc3ef5-d2a0-4324-b829-462006b793cb","text":"Calling a woman a dog because you dislike her appearance is insulting.","translations":{"zh":"因为不喜欢一个女人的外貌就叫她“丑女”，是对她的侮辱。"},"review":{"fact_id":"5fb7b247-e681-47eb-8680-49e57f891081","confidence":0.96,"verdict":"pass"}},{"sentence_id":"a6d77e94-f184-4160-9041-a5eae3299abc","text":"He cruelly called her a dog because of her looks.","translations":{"zh":"他因为她的长相而刻薄地骂她是丑女。"},"review":{"fact_id":"81da25e0-d2bd-4729-8298-da4123bf27af","confidence":0.96,"verdict":"pass"}}],"collocations":[],"topics":[{"id":"appearance","name":{"en":"Appearance","zh":"外貌"},"review":{"fact_id":"11e1855b-7a13-42f7-b535-11e6497e98c6","confidence":0.96,"verdict":"pass"}}],"relations":{"synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"broader":[{"lemma":"woman","sense_id":"03c88674-84b9-4dca-b276-5ceac03d2c13","gloss":"An adult female human being.","review":{"fact_id":"e91f436b-87d2-4a46-9c02-98508edc2757","confidence":0.99,"verdict":"pass"}}],"narrower":[],"part_of":[],"parts":[]},"review":{"gloss":{"fact_id":"b8e95e86-bc3c-468a-90bc-7c0707cff6ea","confidence":1,"verdict":"pass"},"translations":{"zh":[{"fact_id":"402aa1bb-fc44-4966-ad45-326add21708b","confidence":0.99,"verdict":"pass"}]}}},{"id":"d5f2f7ee-1237-4864-a9a6-fd33e4f3e725","image":null,"gloss":"Greyhound racing, especially as an activity involving betting.","labels":["informal"],"region":"british","rare":false,"translations":{"zh":["赛狗（尤指下注的赛狗活动）"]},"grammar":{"number":"plural_only","article":"with_the","patterns":[],"prepositions":[],"review":{"fact_id":"4ae99572-19eb-4e99-8fc8-951c984348cf","confidence":0.97,"verdict":"pass"}},"examples":[{"sentence_id":"05121e32-37fc-4930-ba57-1c1fa27b6f66","text":"We spent an evening at the dogs and placed a few bets.","translations":{"zh":"我们在赛狗场玩了一个晚上，还下了几次注。"},"review":{"fact_id":"d9a44a5c-87f0-4b8b-8a6f-c8e2ee456c0f","confidence":0.99,"verdict":"pass"}},{"sentence_id":"1466be01-97a1-4393-a0c0-b79208a3fe74","text":"My uncle used to go to the dogs every Friday night.","translations":{"zh":"我叔叔以前每周五晚上都去看赛狗。"},"review":{"fact_id":"9a3e293d-43ad-478b-85b6-85e8e2f13aae","confidence":0.98,"verdict":"pass"}}],"collocations":[{"text":"a night at the dogs","pattern":"phrase","translations":{"zh":"观看赛狗比赛的一晚"},"review":{"fact_id":"ef0caffa-12c9-4977-ab09-2bf98f0a1a47","confidence":0.96,"verdict":"pass"}}],"topics":[],"relations":{"synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"broader":[],"narrower":[],"part_of":[],"parts":[]},"review":{"gloss":{"fact_id":"b8e95e86-bc3c-468a-90bc-